<title>USA: First Northern Capital sets stock split.</title>
<headline>First Northern Capital sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>GREEN BAY, Wis. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Northern Capital Corp said Thursday it set a two-for-one stock split in the form of a 100 percent common stock dividend.</p>
<p>The new shares will be issued on August 18 to shareholders of record as of August 1.</p>
<p>First Northern currently has 4,417,035 shares of common stock outstanding, net of treasury stock. After the split, it will have about 8,834,000 shares.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
